## Installation & Setup

### 1. Install Dependencies

After cloning the repository, navigate to the Cypress project folder and run:

```bash
npm install
```

### 2. Open Cypress Test Runner

```bash
npx cypress open
```

Select **E2E Testing** and choose the available browser.

---

## Running Tests

### Run All Tests

```bash
npx cypress run --e2e
```

### Run Login Tests

```bash
npx cypress run --e2e --spec "cypress/e2e/login.cy.js"
```

### Run Product Tests

```bash
npx cypress run --e2e --spec "cypress/e2e/product.cy.js"
```

